# This plugin exists because CRLF in the files Claude Code parses makes them
# silently invisible. Shipping its own sources with CRLF would be the joke that
# writes itself — so line endings are pinned here rather than left to
# core.autocrlf. `* text=auto` alone is NOT enough: without eol=lf, checkout on a
# machine with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into the working tree, which is
# exactly the byte sequence this plugin repairs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf

assets/*.png binary
